# Neovim plugin lockfile: deliberately untracked so each fresh install
# pulls the latest plugin commits via `:Lazy sync` on first launch.
# Committing the lockfile would freeze plugins to whatever the dev machine
# happened to have, which is rarely what we want.
dots/nvim/lazy-lock.json
